# What's on - African Drumming March 2014

[![RC-Flyer-SMALL](/media/2014/03/RC-Flyer-SMALL-1.jpg)](/media/2014/03/RC-Flyer-SMALL-1.jpg)

#### African Drumming Classes in Noosa, Maroochydore and Palmwoods - March/April 2014

**Mondays**

**Noosa course dates @ The j**

African drumming **open** course 6-7pm

Dates: April 28th, May 5th, May 12th, May 19th, May 26th

**Tuesdays**

**Palmwoods course dates @Palmwoods Memorial Hall** African drumming **open** course 6-7pm African dance co-op 7-8pm (gold coin donation) Dates: March 4th, March 18th, March 25th, April 1st & April 8th

**Wednesdays**

_**Maroochydore Course Dates @ Solbar**_ African drumming **open** course 4.45-5.45pm Dates: March 5th, March 19th, March 26th, April 2nd, April 9th

**Wednesday Evenings**

_**Palmwoods Advanced Course Dates @Palmwoods Girl Guides Hut**_

African drumming **advanced** course 6.30-7.30pm

Dates: April 23rd, April 30th, May 7th, May 14th, May 21st

(Please note that the Maroochydore and Palmwoods open 5 week courses runs over a 6 week period this block)

Book your 5 week course BEFORE March 4th and receive your first class FREE! $79.00 (save $21) Come play with us and get into some rhythm culture! FREE drum hire with every 5/10 week booking. You can [Book NOW](/shop-2/drumming-classes/5-drumming-classes-sunshine-coast/) using our online shop!
